    "value": {
      "0": "A shaggy cloak of sheaves and sackcloth that smells of the last field before frost. Scarecrow's Vigil (1 per 90 minutes): a Scarecrow Sentinel stands guard at your side for an hour, growing with your strength; when it falls its straw bursts into a blessing that heals your party. Its power can be used the listed number of times per 90 minutes of real time; resting does not refresh it."
